FREE PUBLIC CORE NOTICE
The free public core of this project (specs, reference code for provenance
and ttlink, founding conversation, governance artefacts) is intended to
remain publicly inspectable. Commercial layers may sit outside this core
without requiring the core to become opaque. See docs/specs/08-boundary-rules.md.
